# 🎨 CSS Text Animations

A collection of creative **CSS text animation effects** for modern websites.

This project explores different ways to animate text using **HTML and CSS** without relying heavily on JavaScript.

## ✨ Features

* 🎯 Text Hover Animations
* ⌨️ Typewriter Effects
* 🌈 Color Animations
* 💡 Neon Glow Effects
* 👾 Glitch Effects
* 🔄 3D Text Animations
* 🌊 Wavy Text Effects
* 🎭 Split Text Animations
* ✨ Text Shadow Effects
* 🎨 Gradient Text Effects

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* CSS Animations
* `@keyframes`
* CSS Transform
* CSS Transition
* CSS Pseudo-elements
* Text Shadow
* Clip Path
* CSS Gradients

## 📌 About

CSS text animations can make websites more attractive and interactive.
They can be used for headings, navigation links, buttons, hero sections, portfolios, and landing pages.

This project is created for **learning, practice, and frontend development**.

## 🚀 Purpose

The main purpose of this project is to understand how CSS animation properties can be combined to create modern text effects.

It is suitable for beginners who want to improve their **HTML and CSS animation skills**.

